{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12336","headline":"送王谏议任东都居守 · 钱起","name":"送王谏议任东都居守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"车徒凤掖东，去去洛阳宫。\n暂以青蒲隔，还看紫禁同。\n经过乘雨露，潇洒出鸳鸿。\n官署名台下，云山旧苑中。\n暮天双阙静，秋月九重空。\n且喜成周地，诗人播国风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}